Server init.

>> x := Blob አዲስ: 65 ዓይነት: ['char'].
# for this test you need set a path to libc (puts)
>> libname := ፕሮግራም ቅንብር: ['FFITESTLIB'].
Server አያይዝ: (
 ሰልፍ አዲስ ;
 libname ;
 ['putchar'] ;
 ( ሰልፍ አዲስ ; ['char'] ) ;
 ['void'] ;
 ['Print'] ;
 ['char:']
).
Print char: (x መነሻ: 0 ርዝመት: 1), አዲስ-መስመር.
x ልቀቅ.

